t("Dwarf", "Enano", "birth descriptor name")
t("Dwarves are a secretive people, hailing from their underground home of the Iron Throne.", "Los enanos son una gente secreta, aclamando desde tu hogar subterráneo del Trono de Hierro.", "_t")
t("They are a sturdy race and are known for their masterwork, yet they are not well loved, having left other races to fend for themselves in past conflicts.", "Ellos son una raza robusta y son conocidos por tu obra maestra, sin embargo no están bien amados, habiendo dejado otras razas para defenderse en conflictos pasados.", "_t")
t("All dwarves are united under the Empire and their love of money.", "Todos los enanos están unidos bajo el Imperio y tu armadura por el dinero.", "_t")
