t("Redhead Hair 5", "Cabello pelirrojo 5", "_t")
t("Bikini / Mankini", "Bikini / Mankini", "_t")
t("Shalore", "Shalore", "birth descriptor name")
t("Shaloren elves have close ties with the magic of the world, and produced in the past many great mages.", "Los elfos de Shaloren tienen estrechos lazos con la magia del mundo, y producidos en los últimos muchos grandes magos.", "_t")
t("Yet they remain quiet and try to hide their magic from the world, for they remember too well the Spellblaze - and the Spellhunt that followed.", "Sin embargo, permanecen tranquilos y tratan de ocultar tu magia del mundo, porque recuerdan demasiado bien el Spellblaze - y el Spellhunt que siguió.", "_t")
t("They possess the #GOLD#Grace of the Eternals#WHITE# talent which allows them a boost of speed every once in a while.", "Poseen el talento #GOLD#Grace de los Eternos#WHITE# que les permite un impulso de velocidad cada vez.", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#Modificadores de atributos:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Magic, +3 Willpower, +1 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Magic, +3 Willpower, +1 Cunning", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 9", "#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 9", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 12%", "#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 12%", "_t")
t("Thalore", "Thalore", "birth descriptor name")
t("Thaloren elves have spent most of the ages hidden within their forests, seldom leaving them.", "Thaloren elves han pasado la mayor parte de las edades escondidas dentro de sus bosques, raramente dejándolos.", "_t")
t("The ages of the world passed by and yet they remained unchanged.", "Las edades del mundo pasaron y sin embargo permanecieron sin cambios.", "_t")
t("Their affinity for nature and their reclusion have made them great protectors of the natural order, often opposing their Shaloren cousins.", "Tu afinidad por la naturaleza y tu reclusión los han hecho grandes protectores del orden natural, a menudo opuestos a sus primos Shaloren.", "_t")
t("They possess the #GOLD#Gift of the Woods#WHITE# talent, which allows them to regenerate life and increase healing once in a while.", "Poseen el talento #GOLD#Gift del Woods#WHITE#, que les permite regenerar la vida y aumentar la curación de vez en cuando.", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +1 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +1 Constitution", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Magic, +1 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Magic, +1 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 11", "#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 11", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 0%", "#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 0%", "_t")

