-- section "mod-tome/data/birth/races/yeek.lua"

-- new text
t("Skin", "Piel", "birth facial category")
t("Hairs", "Pelo", "birth facial category")
t("Facial features", "Rasgos faciales", "birth facial category")
t("Tatoos", "Tatoos", "birth facial category")
t("Special", "Especial", "birth facial category")
t("Yeek", "Yeek", "birth descriptor name")
t("One race, one mind, one way. Our oppression shall end, and we shall inherit Eyal. Do not presume we are weak - our way is true, and only those who help us shall see our strength.", "Una carrera, una mente, una manera. Nuestra opresión terminará, y heredaremos Eyal. No presumáis que somos débiles; nuestro camino es verdadero, y sólo aquellos que nos ayudan verán nuestra fuerza.", "_t")
t("Yeeks are a mysterious race of small humanoids native to the tropical island of Rel.", "Yeeks eres una misteriosa raza de pequeños humanoides nativos de la isla tropical de Rel.", "_t")
t("Their body is covered with white fur and their disproportionate heads give them a ridiculous look.", "Tu cuerpo estás cubierto de piel blanca y sus cabezas desproporcionadas les dan una mirada ridícula.", "_t")
t("Although they are now nearly unheard of in Maj'Eyal, they spent many thousand years as secret slaves to the Halfling nation of Nargol.", "Aunque ahora son casi insensatos en Maj'Eyal, pasaron muchos miles de años como esclavos secretos de la nación de Nargol.", "_t")
t("They gained their freedom during the Age of Pyre and have since then followed 'The Way' - a unity of minds enforced by their powerful psionics.", "Ellos ganaron tu libertad durante la Edad de Pyre y desde entonces han seguido 'El Camino' - una unidad de mentes forzadas por sus poderosas psionics.", "_t")
