t("Be at one with nature.", "Sé uno con la naturaleza.", "_t")
t("harmony", "armonía", "talent type")
t("Nature heals and cleans you.", "La naturaleza te curas y te limpia.", "_t")
t("antimagic", "antimagírico", "talent type")
t("The way to combat magic, or even nullify it.", "La forma de combatir la magia, o incluso anularla.", "_t")
t("summoning (melee)", "convocación (cuerpo a cuerpo)", "talent type")
t("The art of calling creatures adept in melee combat to your aid.", "El arte de llamar a las criaturas depende en el combate a tu ayuda.", "_t")
