t("Strip the protective barriers from your mind for %d turns, allowing in the thoughts all creatures within %d squares but reducing mind save by %d and increasing your mindpower by %d for 10 turns.", "Quita las barreras protectoras de tu mente para %d gira, permitiendo en los pensamientos a todas las criaturas dentro de %d.%d%d", "tformat")
