t("The target's will to defend itself is shattered by the powerful battle cry, reducing defense by %d.", "La voluntad del objetivo de defenderse estás destrozada por el poderoso grito de batalla, reduciendo la defensa por %d.", "tformat")
t("#Target#'s will is shattered.", "La voluntad del Sargento estás destrozada. #Target#", "_t")
