t("A morbidly obese orc with greasy pockmarked skin and oily long black hair.  He's clad in plate mail and carries a huge granite battleaxe that's nearly as large as he is.", "Un orco morboso obeso con piel grasienta y pelo negro largo y aceitoso. Está encerrado en el correo de la placa y lleva un enorme granito de batalla que es casi tan grande como él.", "_t")

