t("rattlesnake", "serpiente de cascabel", "entity name")
t("As you approach, the snake coils up and rattles its tail threateningly.", "A medida que te acercas, la serpiente se enrolla y agita tu cola amenazadamente.", "_t")
t("king cobra", "cobra real", "entity name")
t("It is a large snake with a hooded face.", "Es una serpiente grande con una cara encapuchada.", "_t")
t("black mamba", "mamba negra", "entity name")
t("It has glistening black skin, a sleek body, and highly venomous fangs.", "Tiene una piel negra brillante, un cuerpo elegante y colmillos muy venenosos.", "_t")
t("anaconda", "anaconda", "entity name")
t("You recoil in fear as you notice this gigantic snake.  It seeks to crush the life out of you.", "Te acuestas con miedo cuando notas esta serpiente gigantesca. Busca destruirte la vida.", "_t")

