t("These ancient cursed beings often take the form of a bat and attack their prey.", "Estos antiguos seres malditos a menudo toman la forma de un murciélago y atacan tu presa.", "_t")
t("lesser vampire", "vampiro menor", "entity name")
t("This vampire has only just begun its new life. It has not yet fathomed its newfound power, yet it still has a thirst for blood.", "Este vampiro acaba de empezar tu nueva vida. Aún no ha engordado tu nuevo poder, pero todavía tienes sed de sangre.", "_t")
t("vampire", "vampiro", "entity name")
