t("A fang from the great warg, Rungof, still covered in blood.", "Un colmillo del gran Warg, Rungof, aún cubierto de sangre.", "_t")
t("Khulmanar's Wrath", "Khulmanar's Ira", "entity name")
t("firey blackened battleaxe", "fuego negro batalla hacha", "_t")
t("Blackened with soot and covered in spikes, this battleaxe roars with the flames of the Fearscape. Given by Urh'Rok himself to his general, this powerful weapon can burn even the most resilient of foes.", "Negro con hollín y cubierto de espigas, este hacha de batalla ruge con las llamas del Miedo. Dado por el propio Urh'Rok a tu general, esta poderosa arma puedes quemar incluso el más resistente de los enemigos.", "_t")
t("Bladed Rift", "Bladed Rift", "entity name")
t("hole in space", "agujero en el espacio", "_t")
t("Upon defeat, Ak'Gishil collapsed into this tiny rift. How it remains stable, you are unsure. If you focus, you think you can call forth a sword from it.", "A la derrota, Ak'Gishil colapsó en este pequeño rift. Cómo permanece estable, no estás seguro. Si te concentras, crees que puedes sacar una espada de ella.", "_t")
t("Blade of Distorted Time", "Hoja of Distorted Tiempo", "entity name")
t("time-warped sword", "espada encadenada", "_t")
t("The remnants of a damaged timeline, this blade shifts and fades at random.", "Los restos de un cronograma dañado, esta hoja cambia y se desvanece al azar.", "_t")
t("deals %d temporal damage and slows enemies in radius 6 of the target by %d%% based on Magic", "acuerdos %d daño temporal y retrasa a los enemigos en el radio 6 del objetivo por %d%% basado en Magic", "tformat")
t("Rune of Reflection", "Rune of Reflection", "entity name")
t("You can see your own image mirrored in the surface of this silvery rune.", "Puedes ver tu propia imagen reflejada en la superficie de esta columna plateada.", "_t")
t("shiny rune", "rígido", "_t")
t("The Gaping Maw", "The Gaping Maw", "entity name")
t("huge granite battleaxe", "enorme granito de batalla", "_t")
t("This huge granite battleaxe is as much mace as it is axe.  The shaft is made of blackened wood tightly bound in drakeskin leather and the sharpened granite head glistens with a viscous green fluid.", "Este enorme granito de batalla es tanto mace como axe. El eje estás hecho de madera ennegrecida firmemente atado en cuero de drakeskin y la cabeza de granito afilada brilla con un líquido verde viscoso.", "_t")
t("deal manaburn damage equal to your mindpower in a radius 3 cone", "trato manaburn daño igual a tu fuerza mental en un radio 3 cone", "_t")
t("#DARK_GREEN#You feel like Nature's Wrath incarnate!", "#DARK GREEN # ¡Te sientes como la ira de la naturaleza encarnada!", "logPlayer")

