t("Absorbs all darkness (power %d, based on Willpower and Cunning) within its light radius, increasing its own brightness. (current charge %d).", "Absorbe toda oscuridad (poder %d, basado en Willpower y Cunning) dentro de tu radio de luz, aumentando tu propio brillo. (cargo corriente %d).", "tformat")
